menu "Honch SDK"

config HONCH_ERROR_TRACKING
    bool "Enable automatic error tracking"
    default y
    help
        Compile Honch automatic error tracking support. Disable this to strip
        the SDK-owned fault snapshot and $error emission path from firmware.

config HONCH_CRASH_SYMBOLICATION
    bool "Enable crash symbolication context"
    depends on HONCH_ERROR_TRACKING
    default y
    help
        Include firmware build IDs and raw crash addresses from ESP-IDF ELF
        coredump summaries so Honch can resolve function and source lines after
        matching symbols are uploaded.

endmenu
